        "code_text": "def merge_recursive(l1, l2):\n    if l1 is None:\n        return l2\n    if l2 is None:\n        return l1\n    if l1.val <= l2.val:\n        l1.next = merge_recursive(l1.next, l2)\n        return l1\n    l2.next = merge_recursive(l1, l2.next)\n    return l2\n"
      },
