        "source_ref": "experiments/code_analysis_evaluation/gt_poc/corpus_authored.py#merge_sentinel_swap",
        "code_text": "def merge_sentinel_swap(a, b):\n    if a is None:\n        return b\n    if b is None:\n        return a\n    head = a if a.val <= b.val else b\n    previous = None\n    while a is not None and b is not None:\n        if a.val <= b.val:\n            chosen = a\n            a = a.next\n        else:\n            chosen = b\n            b = b.next\n        if previous is not None:\n            previous.next = chosen\n        previous = chosen\n    previous.next = a if a is not None else b\n    return head\n"
      },
