        "code_text": "import re\n\n\ndef pal_regex_two_ptr(s):\n    letters = re.sub(r\"[^a-zA-Z0-9]\", \"\", s).lower()\n    left = 0\n    right = len(letters) - 1\n    while left < right:\n        if letters[left] != letters[right]:\n            return False\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n    return True\n"
