        "code_text": "def bs_recursive(nums, target):\n    def search(lo, hi):\n        if lo > hi:\n            return -1\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n        if nums[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        if nums[mid] < target:\n            return search(mid + 1, hi)\n        return search(lo, mid - 1)\n\n    return search(0, len(nums) - 1)\n"
